# visual-studio-code
===
Visual Studio Code is a new choice of tool that combines the simplicity of a code editor with what developers need for the core edit-build-debug cycle.

This is an unofficial community AppImage repackaging of the proprietary Microsoft build of Visual Studio Code. This repackaging is not affiliated with or supported by Microsoft.
